                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "President Biden likes to tout that he puts patients & U.S. health care first, yet over 50 million American seniors enrolled in Medicare will be left paying sky high prices on Medicare plans after Oct. 1.\n\nThis is another testament to the Biden Admin\u2019s terrible policies prioritizing inefficient programs rather than the needs of the patient.\nhttps://t.co/azec9tiv4S",
