                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Today, I introduced the Physician Led and Rural Access to Quality Care Act.\n\nAmerican patients are in constant need of high quality care and access to hospitals in our rural communities. This bill supports our physician owned hospitals in rural states. https://t.co/H53azBNSNc",
