                "text": "You would think it is common sense. Bankers own banks, lawyers own law firms. Doctors should have the right to own their own hospitals.\n\nThat is why I introduced a bill that will repeal the Affordable Care Act\u2019s ban on physician owned hospitals. Physicians know their patients better than anyone.\nhttps://t.co/Kq7hQ0bJCf",
